    "detailed_description": "King Unmorr is dead. His great Kingdom of Trasamire is in chaos. Across the realm, pirates, fanatics and usurpers claw for the throne.<br><br>You are one of them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968330/extras/5994381c61d0e66e15e713486e83870f.poster.avif?t=1676137172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968330/extras/5994381c61d0e66e15e713486e83870f.webm?t=1676137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968330/extras/5994381c61d0e66e15e713486e83870f.mp4?t=1676137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Addictive turn-based strategy.</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t<li> Fast-paced battles where your troops are your dice.<br>\t</li><li> Link captured regions to grow your army, while breaking enemy chains to deny them reinforcements.<br>\t</li><li> Tailor your battles with story choices and powerful ability cards.<br>\t</li><li> Perfect for any length session; spend minutes on a battle, or hours on the war.</li></ul></li><li> <strong>Five twisty tales shaped by interesting gameplay.</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t<li> Branching narratives, compelling choices that always matter, and many endings.<br>\t</li><li> A cast of colorful characters whose stories intertwine.<br>\t</li><li> Defeats don\u2019t end the game, but introduce more story consequences.<br>\t</li><li> Chatty AI won't hide how they feel about you.</li></ul></li><li> <strong>Try it!</strong><br><br><i>\u201cIgnore everything this game says about me. <strong>I\u2019m</strong> the greatest hero in the Kingdom!\u201d</i><br>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800-Sir Arthur Clawfyre, non-playable character.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "King Unmorr is dead. His great Kingdom of Trasamire is in chaos. Across the realm, pirates, fanatics and usurpers claw for the throne.<br><br>You are one of them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968330/extras/5994381c61d0e66e15e713486e83870f.poster.avif?t=1676137172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968330/extras/5994381c61d0e66e15e713486e83870f.webm?t=1676137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968330/extras/5994381c61d0e66e15e713486e83870f.mp4?t=1676137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Addictive turn-based strategy.</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t<li> Fast-paced battles where your troops are your dice.<br>\t</li><li> Link captured regions to grow your army, while breaking enemy chains to deny them reinforcements.<br>\t</li><li> Tailor your battles with story choices and powerful ability cards.<br>\t</li><li> Perfect for any length session; spend minutes on a battle, or hours on the war.</li></ul></li><li> <strong>Five twisty tales shaped by interesting gameplay.</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t<li> Branching narratives, compelling choices that always matter, and many endings.<br>\t</li><li> A cast of colorful characters whose stories intertwine.<br>\t</li><li> Defeats don\u2019t end the game, but introduce more story consequences.<br>\t</li><li> Chatty AI won't hide how they feel about you.</li></ul></li><li> <strong>Try it!</strong><br><br><i>\u201cIgnore everything this game says about me. <strong>I\u2019m</strong> the greatest hero in the Kingdom!\u201d</i><br>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800-Sir Arthur Clawfyre, non-playable character.</li></ul>",
